  "tool": {
    "name": "knowledge_facts",
    "description": "Read one versioned knowledge-application fact about this host: `peer_result` (the ask a session stated, the settling reply re-read from the transcript, and the same operation id on both readings), `effective_config` (expected, stored and actually-running model / effort / permission mode plus the process, build and request identity — `verified` is false when any layer is unknown), or `inventory` (a bounded session page that keeps its filters, total and truncation, so an empty page is never reported as an empty host). Every field is either an evidence reading with its source and observation time, or an explicit `unknown` with a reason; the payload also carries the contract name and version, the build id and the running process boot id.",
